  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BH Green Blue: Carbon Reduction Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">BH Verde Azul: Programa de Reduccin de Carbono</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir al desarrollo sostenible e inclusivo de Belo Horizonte (BH) mediante la consolidacin de un nuevo modelo urbano policntrico. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) Consolidar centralidades urbanas, aumentando la oferta de infraestructura y servicios; (ii) Reforzar la resiliencia de la infraestructura urbana verde-azul y la capacidad de adaptacin al cambio climtico; (iii) Fortalecer las capacidades institucionales y sociales para implementar el nuevo modelo urbano policntrico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to contribute to the sustainable and inclusive development of Belo Horizonte through the consolidation of a new polycentric urban model. The specific objectives are: (i) Consolidate urban centralities by increasing the supply of infrastructure and services; (ii) Strengthen the resilience of green-blue urban infrastructure and its capacity to adapt to climate change; (iii) Strengthen institutional and social capacities to implement the new polycentric urban model.</narrative>
  </description>
